Den License

Copyright (c) 2026 Bearocratic

This license covers Den — the binary you install from Homebrew or download
from a release — together with anything bundled inside it (icons,
documentation).

Den is yours to use. Install it on the devices you own or control. Use it
to keep an eye on the repos you work in — for as long as you want. No fees,
no accounts, no telemetry.

A few things we ask in return:

  Please don't redistribute the Den binary as your own, repackage it for
  resale, or take it apart to build something that competes with it. The
  name "Den" and the Bearocratic logo are ours — please don't use them
  for your own projects without asking. If you'd like to ship Den inside
  something you're building, write to us at hello@bearocratic.io — we'll
  find a way.

Den is provided as it is. It will sometimes have bugs, and software is
fragile in ways nobody fully predicts. We can't promise it will never
crash, and we can't be held responsible if it does.

Use it kindly. Make something good with it.
